 🇺🇸 Good Friday morning. Today we're remembering the nearly 3,000 lives lost 25 years ago on Sept. 11, 2001.

 🍯 Shanah Tovah to those celebrating Rosh Hashanah, the Jewish New Year, beginning at sundown tonight. Smart Brevity™ count: 1,687 words ... 6½ mins. Thanks to Noah Bressner for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 

 
 
